            "bugtrack_url": null,
            "classifiers": [],
            "description": "ManiSkill2 is a large-scale robotic manipulation benchmark, focusing on learning generalizable robot agents and manipulation skills. It features 2000+ diverse objects, 20 task categories, and a large-scale demonstration set in [SAPIEN](https://sapien.ucsd.edu/), a fully-physical, realistic simulator. The benchmark can be used to study 2D & 3D vision-based imitation learning, reinforcement learning, and motion planning, etc.\n",
